faqsText:
Is Sector T part of Faisal Town Phase 2? | Yes. Sector T is part of Faisal Town Phase 2 / FT-II.

Can I download the Sector T plan? | Yes. A dedicated Sector T FT-II plan is available on this page.

What plot sizes are available in Sector T? | Current Sector T material lists 5.56, 8, 10.89 and 14.22 marla as well as 1 kanal, but live availability should be confirmed. :contentReference[oaicite:7]{index=7}

Is 14.22 marla available in Sector T? | Current public information is inconsistent. One Sector T source includes a 14.22-marla payment row while also noting reports that the size may not be available. Confirm this directly before booking. :contentReference[oaicite:8]{index=8}

Is Sector T available on installments? | Current Sector T-focused material publishes an installment-based structure, but the exact current schedule should be obtained in writing for the property being offered. :contentReference[oaicite:9]{index=9}

Does Sector T connect to a main boulevard? | Current Sector T material describes access through Boulevard 28, which also connects with nearby Phase 2 areas. :contentReference[oaicite:10]{index=10}

Are plots currently available in Faisal Town Phase 2? | Yes. Current property portals show active Phase 2 plot, residential plot and plot-file inventory, although Sector T-specific availability should be checked separately. :contentReference[oaicite:11]{index=11}

Are Sector T prices fixed? | No. Final cost depends on plot size, exact position, payment status, dues, development and any special-location premium.

Should I compare Sector T with Sector S? | Yes. Compare like-for-like sizes, road position, payment structure, development and total payable amount.

Should I visit Sector T before booking? | Yes. A site visit or trusted live video inspection is recommended before making a substantial payment.
